2
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:24,000
Blackhat is a crime, thriller, action film directed by Michael Mann.

3
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:03,000
Nicholas Hathaway, a furloughed convict, and his American and Chinese partners hunt a
high-level cybercrime network from Chicago to Los Angeles to Hong Kong to Jakarta.

4
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:42,000
As Hathaway closes in, the stakes become personal as he discovers that the
attack on a Chinese nuclear power plant was just the beginning.

5
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:21,000
Nicholas Hathaway, played by Chris Hemsworth.

6
