10
01:06:30,000 --> 01:06:36,000
Alex Trang, played by Andy On Chi-Kit.

11
01:13:09,000 --> 01:13:15,000
Blackhat is a 2015 American action thriller film produced and directed by Michael Mann, written by
Morgan Davis Foehl, and starring Chris Hemsworth, Tang Wei, Viola Davis, and Wang Leehom.

12
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:54,000
Hemsworth portrays a convicted hacker offered clemency for
helping track down a dangerous cybercriminal.

13
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:33,000
The title refers to the cybersecurity term "black hat,"
meaning a hacker with malicious intent.

14
01:33:06,000 --> 01:33:12,000
The film premiered at the TCL Chinese Theatre in Los Angeles on January 8, 2015,
and was released in theaters on January 16, by Universal Pictures.

15
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:51,000
Blackhat was a box-office bomb, earning only $19.7 million at
the box office against a budget of $70 million.

16
01:46:24,000 --> 01:46:30,000
The film received generally mixed reviews, with criticisms focused on casting and
pace, though the film appeared on some critics' year-end lists.

17
01:53:03,000 --> 01:53:09,000
A re-edited director's cut of the film was
released on home video in November 2023.

18
01:59:42,000 --> 01:59:48,000
The film explores themes of race against time,
computer, hacker, computer virus, technology.

19
02:06:21,000 --> 02:06:27,000
The tone is intense.
